35
00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:04.313
What about our love?
What about our promise?

36
00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.472
Was it supposed to be like this?

37
00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.509
What about our love?
What about our promise?

38
00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.395
Was it supposed to be like this?

39
